    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5590" root="جرم" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرْمٌ</span></b>  <i>A sin, a crime, a fault, an offence,</i> or <i>an
act of disobedience,</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَنْبٌ</span>, (S, Msb, * K,)
<i>whether intentional or committed through inadvertence;</i> (Kull voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِثْمٌ</span>;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِيمَةٌ</span></b> ; (S,
Msb, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِمَةٌ</span></b> : (K:) <i>transgression:</i>
(TA:) pl. [of pauc.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْرَامٌ</span> and [of mult.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرُومٌ</span>,
(K,) both of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرْمٌ</span>: the pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِيَمةٌ</span> is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرَائِمُ</span>.
(TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرَامٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا جُرْمَ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا جَرَمَ</span>.

